<title>UK: UK licenses British Aerospace Indonesia jets.</title>
<headline>UK licenses British Aerospace Indonesia jets.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade Secretary Ian Lang said on Thursday he had approved licences for British Aerospace Plc to export 16 Hawk jet trainers and associated equipment to Indonesia.</p>
<p>The 16 aircraft are the second consignment under a contract signed in 1993. Authorisation for the first consignment was announced last December.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom 44-171-542 7767</p>
